\label{thm:local-model-error}
Over a single time step $[t_n, t_{n+1}]$, the local model error satisfies
\begin{equation}
\|\boldsymbol{\varepsilon}(t_{n+1})\|_1 \leq \int_{t_n}^{t_{n+1}} (\Phi_{\mathrm{in}}(s) + \Phi_{\mathrm{out}}(s)) \; ds.
